OCR-B Font for Debian
=====================

Removal of OCR-A
----------------

The original sources contained both the OCR-A and OCR-B fonts,
derived from sources on CTAN.  However, the OCR-A Metafont source is
not DFSG-free and thus it has been removed.

 -- Lachlan Gunn <lachlan@twopif.net>  Sat, 23 Jul 2016 08:12:30 +0200
